OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe day will continue dry. Most
OL,6,Fplaces will see long sunny periods but
OL,7,Fit will be cloudy in the west during
OL,8,Fthe morning. This cloud will clear in
OL,9,Fthe early afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FNo rain is expected overnight
OL,12,Fbut clear periods in the evening will
OL,13,Fdecrease as thickening cloud spreads
OL,14,Feast from midnight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSaturday:FSome early bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells but cloud will increase during
OL,18,Fthe afternoon before patchy light rain
OL,19,Fpushes southeast from the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
